ChatGPT guided me through initializing Git, creating commits, connecting my local project to my GitHub repository, pushing the files, and enabling GitHub Pages.

**Evaluation:**

The portfolio was successfully uploaded and published online. I was also able to open and test the website using my mobile phone.

