## Reflection

Using ChatGPT helped me throughout the development of my personal portfolio website. I learned how to organize HTML, CSS, and JavaScript files, improve website responsiveness, create an interactive Skills carousel, troubleshoot design issues, and deploy a website using GitHub Pages.

I also learned the importance of giving clear instructions and testing the generated code. Instead of accepting every suggestion immediately, I checked the results and requested corrections whenever necessary.

Through this project, I gained a better understanding of website development and how AI tools can assist in the learning and development process.